    "In Module Five, we construct The Execution and Accountability Engine. You will implement a binary daily scorecard that eliminates excuses, design high-stakes social accountability, and master the evening shutdown ritual that clears your mental deck for the next day's first strike.",
    "Finally, in Module Six, we deploy The Ninety-Day Deep Work Sprint. You will learn how to take three months of unbroken, monastic focus and translate it into a ten-thousand-dollar-per-month cash-flow engine that delivers permanent financial and personal autonomy.",
    "This book will demand that you make uncomfortable, radical choices. It will require you to delete apps, turn off screens, say no to low-value social obligations, and endure the profound silence of true boredom. If you are looking for easy shortcuts, close this book now.",
    "However, if you are exhausted by your own excuses, disgusted by your phone addiction, and ready to reclaim your mind and conquer your economic destiny, the blueprints are waiting.",
